+  double-integrator controls per gate. A shared dense descriptor-to-actuator
+  relation provides the explicit transfer assumption. The negative control
+  replaces descriptors with independent vectors while preserving physical
+  dynamics and request randomness exactly. All infeasible worlds were kept;
+  none of the fixed16world seeds was regenerated. Composition is trivial in
+  this serial topology; this is not walking or delayed-credit evidence.
